<title>HONG KONG: Fairwood rights issue 1.8 X subscribed.</title>
<headline>Fairwood rights issue 1.8 X subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based fast food chain Fairwood Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Thursday its issue of 237.24 million rights shares had been 1.8 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Controlling shareholder Neblett Investments Ltd had taken up the provisional allotments of 123.77 million rights shares.</p>
<p>It now held 371.32 million shares, representing about 52.17 percent of Fairwood's issued share capital.</p>
<p>Last month the company proposed to raise HK$83 million by a rights issue of 237.24 million new shares at HK$0.35 each.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
